1
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:17,990
<i>Mai... No,</i>

2
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:20,290
<i>Aiko.</i>

3
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,710
<i>I'm embarrassed.</i>

4
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:53,270
<i>You can be yourself.</i>

5
00:01:12,670 --> 00:01:15,300
<i>Show it to me, and only me,</i>

6
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:17,600
<i>your true self.</i>

7
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:33,570
A dream?!

8
00:01:41,070 --> 00:01:45,050
<i>[Ai-Chan's Secret | Episode 5]</i>

9
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:50,490
I'm glad it was a dream.

10
00:01:50,490 --> 00:01:53,560
And? What about you?

11
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:55,710
What about me?

12
00:01:55,710 --> 00:01:59,990
In other words, do you want to do it with Reo?

13
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,410
- What?
- Have sex.

14
00:02:02,410 --> 00:02:06,480
N-No, well...

15
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,970
How to put it...?

16
00:02:08,970 --> 00:02:12,520
Maybe your desire became your dreams?

17
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:15,670
No, no, no way! What?!

18
00:02:15,670 --> 00:02:16,970
Are you flustered?

19
00:02:16,970 --> 00:02:20,010
I-I-I don't know!

20
00:02:20,010 --> 00:02:23,850
It's my first time, so I don't get the timing and all that.

21
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:28,310
What about you?

22
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:34,550
In my case, I'd want to get intimate with the person I like.

23
00:02:36,110 --> 00:02:38,430
As expected.

24
00:02:39,330 --> 00:02:44,060
As for Reo and I...

25
00:02:46,210 --> 00:02:48,130
Aren't you two going to an amusement park?

26
00:02:48,130 --> 00:02:52,650
Maybe he'll ask about it on the way home.

27
00:02:52,650 --> 00:02:55,650
- You think?
- Yup.

28
00:02:55,650 --> 00:02:58,940
So that's how it goes.

29
00:03:03,110 --> 00:03:06,000
You're not going on a date with that bra, are you?

30
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,270
Something wrong?

31
00:03:08,270 --> 00:03:11,320
Sex appeal is key. That bra will do nothing for him.

32
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:16,370
Seriously? I don't own a proper bra.

33
00:03:16,370 --> 00:03:19,810
Hold on, didn't you buy one in middle school?

34
00:03:19,810 --> 00:03:23,450
It should be around here somewhere.

35
00:03:34,900 --> 00:03:39,260
To think it'll be your time to shine.

36
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:48,320
<i>[Listen, I want you to come as "Aiko" tomorrow.]</i>

37
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:51,190
<i>[It's a long way out, so we should be all right.]</i>

38
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:03,020
Man, she's late.

39
00:04:03,020 --> 00:04:07,570
What, you hitting on pigeons?

40
00:04:07,570 --> 00:04:10,630
Ritsuki, you reek of alcohol.

41
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:13,420
I hit it off with this businessman.

42
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:16,760
We had a heated discussion about the future of Japan's economy,

43
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:19,260
and now look at the time.

44
00:04:20,060 --> 00:04:22,290
I hear you have a date with Aiko?

45
00:04:22,290 --> 00:04:25,040
Yes, though I've just been waiting.

46
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,890
Maybe she's prettying up.

47
00:04:26,890 --> 00:04:29,990
Listen, I was worried about you two.

48
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:33,860
So as her elder brother, I made sure to give her

49
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:36,940
the "talk".

50
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:39,950
I leave her to you.

51
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:42,790
Bye bye!

52
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:47,590
What's his problem?
<i>[Lodging for love, at half the price]</i>

53
00:04:47,590 --> 00:04:49,210
Reo!

54
00:04:55,630 --> 00:04:57,250
Hey.

55
00:04:58,350 --> 00:05:01,220
Why are you "Mai"?

56
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:05,630
See, I get a bit embarrassed as "Aiko".

57
00:05:10,050 --> 00:05:11,960
Sorry.

58
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:19,990
You get a pass, cause you look cute today.

59
00:05:21,170 --> 00:05:23,490
Come on, let's go.

60
00:05:26,090 --> 00:05:27,810
There's so much to do.

61
00:05:27,810 --> 00:05:31,900
It's amazing! Feels like a real date.

62
00:05:31,900 --> 00:05:34,690
Since you're off today, when's your curfew?

63
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:39,410
Oh... uh... whenever.

64
00:05:39,410 --> 00:05:41,070
I see.

65
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:43,560
Then we can take our time.

66
00:05:44,410 --> 00:05:46,680
Is this about "that"?

67
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:51,050
You see... um...

68
00:05:53,740 --> 00:05:55,830
Do you want to do it?

69
00:05:57,470 --> 00:06:00,610
In other words... do "that" with me...

70
00:06:00,610 --> 00:06:03,320
I don't know who told you what,

71
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:05,750
but don't be so stiff.

72
00:06:08,710 --> 00:06:10,820
Of course I do.

73
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:18,430
But I plan to wait until you feel the same way.

74
00:06:20,890 --> 00:06:22,330
Reo...

75
00:06:22,330 --> 00:06:25,230
Let's just enjoy today without all that.

76
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:29,110
- Yeah.
- Let's go.

77
00:06:29,110 --> 00:06:32,110
It's coming, it's coming!

78
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:43,580
♫ <i>Just wanna, wanna, wanna, wanna go and take it</i> ♫

79
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:49,320
♫ <i>Just wanna, wanna, wanna, wanna go and take it</i> ♫

80
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:52,850
Reo, can I spin faster?

81
00:06:52,850 --> 00:06:54,400
How fun!

82
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,620
What should we ride next?

83
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:59,160
I want to ride the ferris wheel.

84
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,660
Let's ride that last.

85
00:07:00,660 --> 00:07:02,630
Are you already tired?

86
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:05,780
Not at all. It's just, spinning rides aren't my forte.

87
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:08,880
Really? My bad.

88
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,490
I felt no sincerity.

89
00:07:10,490 --> 00:07:15,930
You know, dates are super-duper fun!

90
00:07:19,210 --> 00:07:22,800
That smile just now was unfair.

91
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:27,150
Found you!

92
00:07:28,650 --> 00:07:29,900
The Morikawas...

93
00:07:29,900 --> 00:07:31,830
Why are they here?

94
00:07:35,010 --> 00:07:37,650
Getting a head start is unfair.

95
00:07:37,650 --> 00:07:39,930
We're on a date.

96
00:07:39,930 --> 00:07:43,700
Then I just came here to play with Takumi.

97
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:54,490
Yeah, apparently Ritsuki accidentally told Ikumi.

98
00:07:54,490 --> 00:07:57,940
I tried texting you, but it seems you never saw it.

99
00:07:57,940 --> 00:08:00,290
Seriously?

100
00:08:00,290 --> 00:08:05,090
We met one another in such an open area. This must be fate!

101
00:08:05,090 --> 00:08:08,640
- Sorry, could you stop that?
- Why?

102
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:11,030
Right, Reo?

103
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:17,130
He's right.

104
00:08:17,130 --> 00:08:20,090
We're intruding on them.

105
00:08:20,650 --> 00:08:23,830
I see. I'm terribly sorry.

106
00:08:23,830 --> 00:08:26,910
I've never come with friends before,

107
00:08:26,910 --> 00:08:29,250
so I got elated.

108
00:08:31,170 --> 00:08:36,000
I'm sure it would be fun, if I went around with friends.

109
00:08:41,330 --> 00:08:44,960
Is your answer a definite "No"?

110
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,550
Isn't that enough?

111
00:08:55,550 --> 00:08:58,230
I really think that's enough.

112
00:08:58,230 --> 00:09:00,790
I'm having fun!

113
00:09:04,250 --> 00:09:08,380
I ended up yielding.

114
00:09:09,850 --> 00:09:14,280
I like that good-natured part of you.

115
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:16,530
You don't have to like me.

116
00:09:16,530 --> 00:09:19,280
Take her home, please.

117
00:09:20,990 --> 00:09:25,080
It's been so long since I've seen Ikumi that happy.

118
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:29,670
Did you come along for her sake?

119
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:35,750
Oh yeah, go on ahead, Reo.

120
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:45,610
I don't understand the appeal of spinning.

121
00:09:48,590 --> 00:09:52,960
Here, it's on me. Let's take a break.

122
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:56,290
You like this coffee, right?

123
00:09:56,290 --> 00:09:57,480
Really?

124
00:09:57,480 --> 00:10:01,900
Isn't it obvious I know what my crush prefers?

125
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:06,180
You didn't?

126
00:10:06,180 --> 00:10:09,540
Plus, he likes collecting basketball t-shirts,

127
00:10:09,540 --> 00:10:11,930
and his favorite sneaker brand—

128
00:10:11,930 --> 00:10:16,590
My bad, I'm abstaining from coffee.

129
00:10:16,590 --> 00:10:18,820
What? Why?

130
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:21,030
Mai doesn't like coffee,

131
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:24,020
so I thought she'd dislike our kisses.

132
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:30,400
Is that all?

133
00:10:31,830 --> 00:10:34,220
Today, I'm on a date with Mai.

134
00:10:34,220 --> 00:10:36,400
Don't meddle anymore.

135
00:10:36,410 --> 00:10:38,780
Wait, Reo!

136
00:10:57,050 --> 00:11:00,900
Didn't I ask you to seduce Mai?

137
00:11:01,890 --> 00:11:06,260
Do you seriously like him?

138
00:11:09,150 --> 00:11:10,360
I do.

139
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:13,210
Don't you just want to steal him away?

140
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:17,980
Takumi, you'll always be my ally, right?

141
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:20,790
I will.

142
00:11:23,410 --> 00:11:27,630
If it's for you, I'd do anything.

143
00:11:29,690 --> 00:11:32,610
Couldn't you have been kinder?

144
00:11:32,610 --> 00:11:35,130
Be kind, and then what?

145
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:40,970
Was it... all for me?

146
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:47,260
I didn't want you to make that face.

147
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:50,770
How lame. I'm losing my cool.

148
00:11:50,770 --> 00:11:53,600
Same here.

149
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:57,610
I didn't even know what you like.

150
00:11:57,610 --> 00:12:00,890
Ikumi knew you better.

151
00:12:00,890 --> 00:12:03,250
I felt frustrated.

152
00:12:04,450 --> 00:12:07,280
I want to become someone

153
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:10,340
who understands you the most.

154
00:12:17,140 --> 00:12:19,790
Just remain as you are, Aiko.

155
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:27,300
Even so, Ikumi looked so sad.

156
00:12:28,780 --> 00:12:33,710
I don't want you to hurt her like that.

157
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:36,690
You're right.

158
00:12:36,690 --> 00:12:39,650
I may have been a bit harsh.

159
00:12:51,130 --> 00:12:53,100
- Let's head back.
- Yeah.

160
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:59,580
- Have you seen Ikumi?
- No, we haven't.

161
00:12:59,580 --> 00:13:02,690
- I took my eyes off her, and she disappeared.
- What?

162
00:13:07,850 --> 00:13:09,720
Pardon me.

163
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,390
- Reo! Did you find her?
- No.

164
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:18,620
- Where is she?
- I don't know.

165
00:13:18,620 --> 00:13:21,780
- I'll look over there.
- Then I'll go this way.

166
00:13:42,180 --> 00:13:46,830
We've been looking for you. What're you doing? You haven't even answered your phone.

167
00:14:01,210 --> 00:14:02,970
Mai!

168
00:14:03,910 --> 00:14:06,410
- Sorry about all this.
- Why?

169
00:14:06,410 --> 00:14:07,940
Because...

170
00:14:07,940 --> 00:14:11,540
Don't worry, we'll find her.

171
00:14:16,190 --> 00:14:18,640
Oh, found them! All right, let's go.

172
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:21,230
Wait up!

173
00:14:21,230 --> 00:14:24,850
It's been my dream to ride a ferris wheel with my crush.

174
00:14:24,850 --> 00:14:26,600
Same here.

175
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:29,060
- Then our dreams came true!
- Not mine.

176
00:14:29,060 --> 00:14:31,380
After all, Mai's not here.

177
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:37,200
You're too cold to other girls, aside from Mai.

178
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:41,590
I have no interest in anyone but her.

179
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:47,280
Even so, I...

180
00:14:51,590 --> 00:14:54,390
Why did we get on?

181
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:57,920
We should have waited on the ground.

182
00:14:57,920 --> 00:15:00,410
Oh, you're right.

183
00:15:00,410 --> 00:15:02,680
You must be an idiot.

184
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:06,210
Either way, I'm glad we found her.

185
00:15:07,220 --> 00:15:09,410
Why do you look so happy?

186
00:15:09,410 --> 00:15:12,420
Because Ikumi was safe and sound!

187
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:17,990
You're seriously good-natured.

188
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:25,270
Ikumi is trying to steal your boyfriend.

189
00:15:26,470 --> 00:15:28,110
"Steal"?

190
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:35,510
I'm fine with receiving half of whatever Mai gets.

191
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,650
Just please, fall in love with me.

192
00:15:41,230 --> 00:15:44,400
Ikumi has never failed in seducing a man.

193
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:46,360
What?

194
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:50,930
She's stolen boyfriends from ever single girl who's bullied her.

195
00:15:50,930 --> 00:15:54,270
You have no chance of winning against her.

196
00:15:55,970 --> 00:15:59,700
Plus, you're alone with me.

197
00:16:04,250 --> 00:16:08,200
I'll protect Ikumi, no matter the method.

198
00:16:08,220 --> 00:16:10,180
I'll do anything.

199
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:13,330
Anything...?

200
00:16:13,330 --> 00:16:18,150
If necessary, I can sleep with some girl I don't care about.

201
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:19,320
Why?

202
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:23,760
Isn't it hard to lay hands on a girl who's had sex?

203
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:29,220
- What the hell?
- That's how I've protected her.

204
00:16:29,220 --> 00:16:31,380
Is that what you want?

205
00:16:31,990 --> 00:16:35,760
That's pretty sad.

206
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:38,410
- Like you'd understand—
- Yeah, I don't.

207
00:16:38,410 --> 00:16:40,770
I don't understand at all.

208
00:16:40,770 --> 00:16:43,780
But you know,

209
00:16:43,780 --> 00:16:46,220
sleeping with some girl you don't love,

210
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:48,690
that's just sad!

211
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:59,870
You should worry about what's going on over there.

212
00:17:01,830 --> 00:17:04,020
Aren't you worried?

213
00:17:05,620 --> 00:17:08,040
"Worried"...

214
00:17:15,560 --> 00:17:17,750
Morikawa,

215
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:20,730
I'm sure you'd become my ideal girlfriend.

216
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:25,810
You'd do your best to make me happy.

217
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:27,730
Of course I would.

218
00:17:27,730 --> 00:17:30,400
Mai doesn't get that at all.

219
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:33,700
I have to put in all the effort.

220
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:36,110
It's a lot of work.

221
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:38,780
- In that case—
- Right now,

222
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:43,260
my love for Mai, feels greater than hers.

223
00:17:44,410 --> 00:17:48,190
But she's doing her best to reciprocate.

224
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:51,250
That's why...

225
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:55,000
I want to treasure her.

226
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:59,760
I appreciate your confession,

227
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:01,660
but I'm sorry.

228
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,520
Ikumi!

229
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:17,990
Mai?

230
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,860
We were riding behind you guys.

231
00:18:22,350 --> 00:18:24,380
Does that bother you?

232
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:33,280
- Wait!
- What do you want, let go!

233
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:35,190
Everyone was worried!

234
00:18:35,190 --> 00:18:38,290
- At the very least, thank Takumi.
- Huh?

235
00:18:39,180 --> 00:18:41,650
Don't you have more pressing complaints?

236
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:45,420
- Like what?
- You were fine with all that?

237
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:48,540
I was with Reo.

238
00:18:48,540 --> 00:18:51,290
Why not get a little jealous?

239
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:59,850
I won't lose to you.

240
00:19:01,830 --> 00:19:05,890
If you're serious, then I accept your challenge.

241
00:19:06,630 --> 00:19:08,970
I won't lose either.

242
00:19:10,290 --> 00:19:15,260
So stop stealing boys you have no interest in!

243
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:18,690
I see Takumi told you.

244
00:19:19,630 --> 00:19:21,520
He's worried about you!

245
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:24,790
- He treats you preciously—
- I know!

246
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:30,890
I don't understand...

247
00:19:30,890 --> 00:19:33,590
I don't understand why Reo likes you.

248
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:37,400
- Give it a rest!
- I hate people like you!

249
00:19:40,350 --> 00:19:42,320
What the hell?

250
00:19:44,230 --> 00:19:46,720
♫ <i>What awaits in this battle of love?</i> ♫

251
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:48,500
Let's go home.

252
00:19:49,790 --> 00:19:52,190
Sorry to bother you two.

253
00:19:52,890 --> 00:19:57,150
♫ <i>So I won't let you go easy on me</i> ♫

254
00:20:07,510 --> 00:20:11,580
♫ <i>I don't wish for anyone to know my secret</i> ♫

255
00:20:11,580 --> 00:20:13,870
Are you mad?

256
00:20:13,870 --> 00:20:15,600
Not really.

257
00:20:17,030 --> 00:20:19,040
Rather,

258
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:22,120
you were watching us, right?

259
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:27,480
Weren't you worried?

260
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:33,500
Well, I was, but…

261
00:20:33,500 --> 00:20:35,160
"But"?

262
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,990
I...

263
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:41,300
trust in you.

264
00:21:01,210 --> 00:21:04,540
Thanks, Aiko.

265
00:21:04,540 --> 00:21:10,490
♫ <i>I make you acting like a kid with just a sweet kiss</i> ♫

266
00:21:10,490 --> 00:21:16,090
♫ <i>Only I know this</i> ♫

267
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:17,920
♫ <i>Rather than touching, we can melt
into one another's embrace</i> ♫

268
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:20,420
To be honest, I was jealous.

269
00:21:21,530 --> 00:21:23,420
I...

270
00:21:23,420 --> 00:21:26,480
got jealous after hearing you rode the ferris wheel with Takumi.

271
00:21:28,310 --> 00:21:33,350
♫ <i>I'll steal you away before anyone gets the chance</i> ♫

272
00:21:33,350 --> 00:21:35,490
You got jealous?

273
00:21:38,020 --> 00:21:41,770
Yeah, cause...

274
00:21:41,770 --> 00:21:46,110
I want all of your "firsts".

275
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:06,330
<i>Does that bother you?</i>

276
00:22:06,330 --> 00:22:09,560
Reo, you have it just as hard.

277
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:14,240
Mai's a busybody... no, she's too good-natured.

278
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:17,570
And I love her for all that.

279
00:22:19,830 --> 00:22:21,950
How sweet.

280
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:27,970
You know, I understand how you feel.

281
00:22:29,310 --> 00:22:33,230
Sounds like you're saying you like her too.

282
00:22:33,230 --> 00:22:36,870
Yes, maybe that's it.

283
00:22:41,860 --> 00:22:45,280
I... might like her.

284
00:23:00,450 --> 00:23:01,930
<i>[Next time]
Don't be alone with Takumi.</i>

285
00:23:01,930 --> 00:23:03,550
<i>Those two suit one another.</i>

286
00:23:03,550 --> 00:23:04,990
<i>You're free to fall in love with whoever you want.</i>

287
00:23:04,990 --> 00:23:06,640
<i>I decided to be honest with myself.</i>

288
00:23:06,640 --> 00:23:09,320
<i>- She's my toy.
- Why not find a new one?</i>

289
00:23:09,320 --> 00:23:12,580
<i>- Were you testing me?
- That's what I want to say. Why did you lie?</i>

290
00:23:12,580 --> 00:23:15,150
<i>You must have been so scared. Your legs gave out.</i>
